<h1>Run report</h1><p>Selected run metrics and summaries. Metadata tables, queue data, device logs and artifacts are excluded.</p><h2>Training performance</h2><p>Value summary: latest for step durations. Throughput always shows the median of retained valid nonnegative samples, not a time-weighted or whole-run rate. For an even sample count, median averages the two middle values. Step durations are converted from seconds to milliseconds. Not reported means no valid value was found in retained history.</p><div class="table-scroll" role="region" aria-label="Training performance" tabindex="0"><table id="training-performance"><tr><th>Run</th><th>Mean ms/step</th><th>Max ms/step</th><th>Median tokens/sec</th></tr><tr><td class="run-name">a/same</td><td>Not reported</td><td>Not reported</td><td>Not reported</td></tr></table></div><table><tr><th>Run</th><th>State</th><th>Step</th><th>Latest metrics</th><th>Benchmarks</th><th>Trainer time</th></tr><tr><td>a/same</td><td>running</td><td>2</td><td>loss: 1</td><td>latency: 1 ms</td><td>20s (last logged)</td></tr></table><h2>Metric values</h2><p class="dim">Value summary: latest in each metric's logged units. Search above or use Next metrics to browse every reported numeric metric in retained history. Missing samples are not filled or counted as zero.</p><div class="table-scroll" role="region" aria-label="Metric values" tabindex="0"><table id="metric-values"><tr><th>Metric</th><th>a/same</th></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="metric-name">loss</th><td>1</td></tr></table></div><figure data-key="loss%7Ca%2Fsame"><figcaption>loss <span class="dim">· Gaussian overlay · faint: raw</span><span class="dim" data-chart-state=""></span></figcaption><div class="legend"><span data-colour="0" title="a/same" aria-label="a/same" tabindex="0"><b>1</b><span class="legend-name"><span class="legend-prefix">same</span><span class="legend-suffix"></span></span></span></div><svg class="plot" role="img" width="984" height="252" viewBox="0 0 984 252" aria-label="loss by step"><line data-grid="" x1="60" x2="960" y1="196" y2="196" stroke="#dce2eb"></line><text data-y-tick="" x="52" y="200" text-anchor="end">1</text><text data-x-tick="0" x="60" y="218" text-anchor="start">1</text><line data-grid="" x1="60" x2="960" y1="151" y2="151" stroke="#dce2eb"></line><text data-y-tick="" x="52" y="155" text-anchor="end">1.75</text><text data-x-tick="0.25" x="285" y="218" text-anchor="middle">1.25</text><line data-grid="" x1="60" x2="960" y1="106" y2="106" stroke="#dce2eb"></line><text data-y-tick="" x="52" y="110" text-anchor="end">2.5</text><text data-x-tick="0.5" x="510" y="218" text-anchor="middle">1.5</text><line data-grid="" x1="60" x2="960" y1="61" y2="61" stroke="#dce2eb"></line><text data-y-tick="" x="52" y="65" text-anchor="end">3.25</text><text data-x-tick="0.75" x="735" y="218" text-anchor="middle">1.75</text><line data-grid="" x1="60" x2="960" y1="16" y2="16" stroke="#dce2eb"></line><text data-y-tick="" x="52" y="20" text-anchor="end">4</text><text data-x-tick="1" x="960" y="218" text-anchor="end">2</text><text data-axis-label="" x="510" y="244" text-anchor="middle">step</text><svg class="chart" x="60" y="16" width="900" height="180" viewBox="0 0 900 180" preserveAspectRatio="none" tabindex="0" aria-label="Chart samples: use left and right arrow keys to inspect" data-axis="step" data-y-low="1" data-y-high="4" data-low="1" data-high="2"><rect width="900" height="180" fill="transparent"></rect><polyline fill="none" stroke="currentColor" data-colour="0" stroke-width="1" stroke-opacity="0.12" stroke-dasharray="none" data-series="0" data-kind="raw" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" data-label="a/same (raw)" data-samples="[[1.0,4.0],[1.0,4.0],[2.0,1.0],[2.0,1.0]]" points="0.00,0.00 0.00,0.00 900.00,180.00 900.00,180.00 "></polyline><polyline fill="none" stroke="currentColor" data-colour="0" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-dasharray="none" data-series="0" data-kind="value" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" data-label="a/same (Gaussian)" data-samples="[[1.0,4.0],[1.0,4.0],[2.0,1.0],[2.0,1.0]]" points="0.00,0.00 0.00,0.00 900.00,180.00 900.00,180.00 "></polyline><line data-cursor="" x1="0" x2="0" y1="0" y2="180" stroke="#63738a" stroke-dasharray="3 3" visibility="hidden"></line></svg></svg><div class="actions"><span class="dim">Hover or use arrow keys for values · Ctrl/⌘ + scroll to zoom · drag to pan when zoomed</span><button type="button" data-zoom="0.8" aria-label="Zoom in">+</button><button type="button" data-zoom="1.25" aria-label="Zoom out">−</button><button type="button" data-reset="">Reset zoom</button></div><output aria-live="off"></output><div class="table-scroll chart-readout" role="region" aria-label="Chart sample values" tabindex="0" hidden=""><table><thead><tr><th>Series</th><th>step</th><th>Gaussian</th><th>Raw</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr data-series="0"><td><details class="series-name"><summary data-colour="0" aria-label="a/same">1<span class="series-short"> · same</span></summary><span data-series-full="">a/same</span></details></td><td data-sample-x="">—</td><td data-sample-value="">—</td><td><span data-sample-raw="">—</span><small data-sample-raw-x=""></small></td></tr></tbody></table></div></figure><h2 id="benchmarks">Benchmark summary</h2><table><tr><th>Metric / unit</th><th>a/same</th></tr><tr><td>latency (ms, lower)</td><td class="">1 (Δ 0) </td></tr></table>
